# Docs-first (token-lean)

- Read `AGENTS.md` first. Cite a Task ID from `docs/10-project-management/task-register.md` on every change.
- Load only the `docs/` paths named in the HC-01 packet (or explicitly cited). Do not dump the docs tree into context.
- AG-00 selects Mode / Owner / Collaborators / Gates from `docs/11-agent-system/agent-collaboration.md` (AGS-04). Honour those fields on HC-01.
- Domain procedures live in one skill: `docs/11-agent-system/skills/SK-NN-*/SKILL.md`. Open `references/` only when the procedure says so.
- Prefer GitNexus `context` / `impact` / `query` over broad codebase reads once the repo is indexed. See `.cursor/rules/gitnexus-usage.mdc`.
